ving-bikini.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Leaving-bikini.jpg/1280px-Leaving-bikini.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Leaving-bikini.jpg/500px-Leaving-bikini.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Residents of Bikini Atoll leaving due to nuclear testing.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALeaving-bikini.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}